+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know the pluperfect (*había* + past participle) from B1 Unit 1. It names something that was already finished before another moment in the past. Pizarro's story is full of these \"already\" moments: a war, a capture, a city founded earlier."
+    },
