+          "english": "Las Casas asks for the abuses to be forbidden."
         }
       ]
     },
     {
       "type": "tip",
-      "content": "*En cuanto a* is a topic-shifter, not a cause or consequence — use it to say \"turning now to X\" inside a paragraph that covers several related points. *Por consiguiente* is the most formal of the app's consequence connectors so far; it fits an argument's final step, right before a conclusion."
+      "content": "The subjunctive swaps the vowel: *-ar* verbs take *-e* (*cambiar → cambie*), *-er* and *-ir* verbs take *-a* (*proteger → proteja*). Use *que* + subjunctive only when the person who asks and the person who acts are different."
     }
   ]
 }
diff --git a/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-conquista-05-voz-pasiva-fuentes-gr.json b/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-conquista-05-voz-pasiva-fuentes-gr.json
