-          "english": "In 1542, the New Laws were enacted, which tried to limit the power of the encomenderos."
+          "spanish": "Cada año se enviaba a un grupo de hombres a las minas de Potosí.",
+          "english": "Every year a group of men was sent to the mines of Potosí."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Con el tiempo, se fue sustituyendo la encomienda por el repartimiento.",
-          "english": "Over time, the encomienda was gradually replaced by the repartimiento."
+          "spanish": "Se trabajaba por turnos, y se pagaba un salario bajo.",
+          "english": "People worked in shifts, and a low wage was paid."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "En 1550, en Valladolid, se organizó un debate formal sobre si los indígenas tenían plena condición humana.",
-          "english": "In 1550, in Valladolid, a formal debate was organized over whether indigenous people had full human status."
