     },
     {
       "type": "tip",
-      "content": "Notice the difference in tense between *se favorecía* / *se exigía* / *se reservaban* (imperfect — describing a standing rule or repeated practice) and *se generó* / *se acumuló* (preterite — a process that built up and eventually reached a conclusion). The se-passive works with both, and the choice of tense carries real meaning."
+      "content": "The article agrees with the noun you describe (*el grupo*, *la sociedad*, *los grupos*, *las autoridades*) and the preposition is the one the verb needs: *pertenecer a*, *vivir en*, *depender de*. Never leave it out: not *el grupo que pertenecía*."
     }
   ]
 }
diff --git a/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-sociedadcolonial-03-iglesia-gr.json b/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-sociedadcolonial-03-iglesia-gr.json
